{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H25的暂时退后、H12的独自容纳不确定，以及H17、H18、H22所确立的真实快乐与未被填满的需要，共同支撑亲近变得更直接、更强烈而不等于认定对方已经回应，没有新增前史或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H11和H20已确立快乐尚在时就会出现心疼与舍不得，H15也已确立欢喜和心酸能够同时存在，因此把欢喜的浓度进一步解释为身体压迫感，是接在既有历史上的局部心理桥。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H6、H13、H20和H24已确立时间意识、回望亲近留下的痕迹、快乐中的留恋及经历不会被流逝抹除，而旧房子只是比喻，没有引入真实往事或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H3、H9的悬念，H10、H18的亲近与欢喜，以及H12、H20、H24所确立的不确定、时间流逝和经历的真实性，共同支撑当下得到某种满足却仍无未来保证的感受，没有把音乐变化直接当成心理原因，也未改变整条Thread的主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都明确写出了当下感受及其心理因果链，H编号、小节号和前后段落只是定位与追溯线索，不妨碍读者理解其核心情绪及仍未解决的悬念。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9df196bd-dc3f-4702-af6a-e1a8bc89e617", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144315759527Z", "elapsed_seconds": 323.5, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:48:39.279686+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a104c433ce829784de36c38f4737053d467e2eec13ceb3c162526b0376f337a6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false,